{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And this was the work of the Menorah, hammered.</b> And this is the very purpose aimed at in the kindling of the lamps toward the face of the Menorah — it is itself aimed at the matter of the requirement that the Menorah be hammered from one piece, to indicate the unity directed toward a single end in itself."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:38:56.913439802Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}